   "edited": "2026-09-28T03:06:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "984a3d42-3738-4884-bb3c-98604d844abf",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "KEEP REPOSITORY ISOLATION GATE."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-28T03:06:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-28T03:06:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "47ae6050-a956-4a86-8423-1b8e10ecb19a",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Do not use or modify Umm-sara, main, or umm-sarah-web as Central Runtime infrastructure."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-28T03:06:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-28T03:06:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "ae0b322a-8798-473d-b6f9-596573ff8e36",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Do not create paid resources without explicit authorization."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-28T03:06:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-28T03:06:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "67a958f0-ceda-4674-9038-58e4a2ee29d7",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Do not treat Render Free Key Value or Cloudflare Workflows Free as a complete production Durable Runtime."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-28T03:06:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-28T03:06:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "0812da5c-8672-4871-ace9-a2c5129e4c23",
   "type": "heading_2",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Side-Effect Check"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-28T03:06:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-28T03:06:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "0128daa2-79d4-4396-9576-fd9ff2b981b8",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "No safe in-scope infrastructure mutation is currently available. Creating a repository, provisioning production compute, or upgrading persistence would cross an authorization or isolation boundary."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-28T03:06:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-28T03:06:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "65ba95d2-6e23-4453-b995-795d22810567",
   "type": "heading_2",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Fix Applied"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-28T03:06:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-28T03:06:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "93fcf028-5276-49f5-84a3-5ad392170491",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Read-only live reconciliation + fresh official-source validation only."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-28T03:06:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-28T03:06:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "e2e26f66-564e-4008-bd38-11c4bd74113a",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
